{% block content %}{% raw %}
<section class="tour-hero">
    <h1>赛库普瀑布徒步之旅</h1>
    <p style="font-size:1.2rem;margin-top:10px;">茂密的丛林、隐藏的瀑布和北部山谷</p>
</section>

<main class="tour-container">
    <div class="tour-grid">
        <div class="tour-description">
            <p style="font-size:1.1rem;margin-bottom:30px;color:#444;">沉浸在北巴厘岛狂野的美景中。赛库普瀑布被誉为岛上最壮观的瀑布，由雄伟的双瀑布组成，从 80 米高处倾泻入茂密的丛林峡谷。在经过认证的当地村庄专家的带领下，您将徒步穿过异国情调的水果种植园，涉过溪流，并发现完美的天然水池，享受清凉的游泳体验。</p>
            
            <h2 class="section-heading">行程安排</h2>
            <ul class="itinerary-list">
                <li class="itinerary-item">
                    <div class="itinerary-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-car"></i></div>
                    <div class="itinerary-details"><h3>07:00 AM – 酒店接送</h3><p>在我们的私人空调专车上放松身心，前往巴厘岛北部的山区。</p></div>
                </li>
                <li class="itinerary-item">
                    <div class="itinerary-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-person-hiking"></i></div>
                    <div class="itinerary-details"><h3>09:30 AM – 赛库普丛林徒步</h3><p>在村庄与您的当地向导会合，开始穿过茂密热带植物和香料农场的下坡徒步。</p></div>
                </li>
                <li class="itinerary-item">
                    <div class="itinerary-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-water"></i></div>
                    <div class="itinerary-details"><h3>10:30 AM – 赛库普与斐济瀑布 (Fiji Waterfall)</h3><p>站在双瀑布的底部感受震撼。感受水雾，并在天然岩池中游泳。</p></div>
                </li>
                <li class="itinerary-item">
                    <div class="itinerary-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-utensils"></i></div>
                    <div class="itinerary-details"><h3>01:30 PM – 观景午餐</h3><p>在可俯瞰山谷的当地餐厅享用传统的印尼午餐。</p></div>
                </li>
                <li class="itinerary-item">
                    <div class="itinerary-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-mountain"></i></div>
                    <div class="itinerary-details"><h3>03:00 PM – 双子湖观景台 (Twin Lakes)</h3><p>在百度库高地 (Bedugul) 全景俯瞰布扬湖 (Lake Buyan) 和坦布林根湖 (Lake Tamblingan)。</p></div>
                </li>
                <li class="itinerary-item">
                    <div class="itinerary-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-car"></i></div>
                    <div class="itinerary-details"><h3>05:30 PM – 返回酒店</h3><p>私人专车送回您的巴厘岛酒店。</p></div>
                </li>
            </ul>

            <!-- Gallery -->
            <div class="tour-gallery">
                <h2>旅游图集</h2>
                <div class="gallery-grid">
                    <div class="gallery-item"><img src="/src/assets/sekumpul/trekking-sekumpul.webp" alt="Trekking through jungle to Sekumpul" fetchpriority="high" width="300" height="225"></div>
                    <div class="gallery-item"><img src="/src/assets/sekumpul/sekumpul-waterfall-trekking-path.webp" alt="Jungle trekking path" loading="lazy" width="300" height="225"></div>
                    <div class="gallery-item"><img src="/src/assets/sekumpul/sekumpul-waterfall-trekking-route.webp" alt="Lush jungle trekking route" loading="lazy" width="300" height="225"></div>
                    <div class="gallery-item"><img src="/src/assets/sekumpul/sekumpul-rice-terrace.webp" alt="Rice terraces on the way" loading="lazy" width="300" height="225"></div>
                    <div class="gallery-item"><img src="/src/assets/sekumpul/experience-nature-side.webp" alt="Fiji Waterfall" loading="lazy" width="300" height="225"></div>
                    <div class="gallery-item"><img src="/src/assets/sekumpul/sekumpul-waterfall-forest.webp" alt="Majestic Sekumpul Waterfall" loading="lazy" width="300" height="225"></div>
                    <div class="gallery-item"><img src="/src/assets/sekumpul/twin-lake-view.webp" alt="Twin Lakes panoramic viewpoint" loading="lazy" width="300" height="225"></div>
                    <div class="gallery-item"><img src="/src/assets/sekumpul/twin-lake-view-north-bali.webp" alt="Aerial view of Twin Lakes" loading="lazy" width="300" height="225"></div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="faq-section">
                <h2>常见问题解答 (FAQ)</h2>
                <div class="faq-item">
                    <button class="faq-question">赛库普瀑布徒步有多难？ <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down faq-chevron"></i></button>
                    <div class="faq-answer"><p>徒步具有中等挑战性——大约 450 级台阶穿过茂密的丛林、过河，然后再爬上去。往返大约需要 1.5–2 小时。建议具备一定的体能。我们经过认证的当地向导会全程配合您的步调。</p></div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-item">
                    <button class="faq-question">参加这个瀑布游我应该穿什么？ <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down faq-chevron"></i></button>
                    <div class="faq-answer"><p>请穿着抓地力好的包趾鞋——由于步道可能很滑，凉鞋或人字拖不合适。建议穿着速干衣或在里面穿上泳衣，因为靠近瀑布时您很可能会被淋湿。请携带防水袋存放手机和贵重物品。</p></div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-item">
                    <button class="faq-question">这项徒步活动适合儿童吗？ <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down faq-chevron"></i></button>
                    <div class="faq-answer"><p>8 岁及以上且体能良好的儿童可以在成人监督下完成徒步。部分台阶很陡，我们的向导会在较困难的路段协助儿童。</p></div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-item">
                    <button class="faq-question">我们可以在赛库普瀑布游泳吗？ <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down faq-chevron"></i></button>
                    <div class="faq-answer"><p>可以！在赛库普瀑布底部的天然岩池中游泳是本次旅行的亮点之一。在丛林徒步之后，冰凉清新的水令人精神焕发。请务必带上泳衣！</p></div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-item">
                    <button class="faq-question">赛库普旅游的价格包括哪些项目？ <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down faq-chevron"></i></button>
                    <div class="faq-answer"><p>全包服务：从巴厘岛酒店出发的私人空调车接送、英语司机、赛库普村的专业当地徒步向导、所有瀑布门票、传统印尼午餐、瓶装矿泉水以及所有停车费和过路费。</p></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

